/****************************************************************
 * HealthPack
 *
 * Things that you should touch to "get". They can be turned on and
 * look special.
 *
 * @version $1.0$
 * @author  Jesse (Jesse@digitalextremes.com)
 * @date    Jan 2004
 ****************************************************************
